  body: "<p>FluxEncoder parses commands with <strong>System.CommandLine 2.0</strong>, renders terminal output with <strong>Spectre.Console</strong>, and pins every package version centrally in <code>Directory.Packages.props</code> with committed NuGet lock files.</p>"
