<h2>Consequences</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Trimming &amp; NativeAOT safety:</strong> Command definitions are explicit C# code in <code>src/FluxEncoder.Cli/Commands/</code>, allowing the IL trimmer and NativeAOT compiler to analyze the entire call graph without reflection roots.</li>
  <li><strong>Consistent invocation under Microsoft.Testing.Platform:</strong> Running <code>dotnet test</code> uses <code>dotnet test --solution fluxencoder.sln</code> or <code>./fluxb.ps1 Test</code>, with native JUnit, TRX, and CTRF report output in CI.</li>
</ul>
